	</style>
	
</head>
	
<body>
	
	<header>
	<img src="logo.png" width="200" alt="logo">
		
	
	</header>
	<wrapper>
		
		<h1>Welcome to Umai Bakes!</h1>
	<main>
	<banner>
			
	<p>Where Tradition Meets Sweetness</p>
	</banner>
	</main>
	
	
		<h2>Enjoy our signature<br> Japanese pastries and Milk Tea!</h2>
		<hr>
	<div>
		<nav> 
			<p><a href="#Menu">Menu</a></p>
			<p><a href="#Contact">Contact</a></p>
			<p><a href="#Locations">Locations</a></p>
			
		</nav>
		
		<hr>
	</div>
			
	<h2>Try our favorite</h2>
		
	<section>
		<h3>Bread</h3> 
		
	<div class="menu-card" id="Menu">
		<img src="anpan.jpg" width="300" alt="bread" class="bread">
		<p>Soft, fluffy, and baked fresh daily, our breads bring the warmth of a true Japanese bakery to your hands. From sweet melonpan and classic anpan to creamy cornetti and delicate sandos, every bite is crafted with traditional techniques and premium ingredients. </p>
		<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="btn">Order</a>
	</div>
		</section>
		
		<section>
		<h3>Dessert</h3>
		
	<div class="menu-card">
		<img src="mochi.jpg" width="300" alt="mochi">
		<p>A celebration of Japanese sweetness. Enjoy chewy mochi, colorful dango, delicate daifuku, and comforting zenzai—each made with time‑honored methods that honor the flavors and textures of authentic wagashi.</p>
		<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="btn">Order</a>
	</div>
			</section>
		
			<section>
		<h3>Drinks</h3>
		
	<div class="menu-card">
		<img src="boba.jpg" width="300" alt="boba" class="drinks">
		<p>Refreshing teas and creamy blends inspired by asian café culture. Sip on milk teas, fruit teas, taro, Thai, and more—brewed with real ingredients for a smooth, balanced taste that feels genuinely crafted.</p>
		<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="btn">Order</a>
	</div>
			</section>
		
		
		<div class="hours" id="Contact">
			<h3>Hours &amp; Location</h3>
			<p>Mon-Sat: 7am-6pm</p>
			<p>(450) 210-2892</p>
		</div>
		
		<iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3507.6514533952127!2d139.69805437592964!3d35.659062231191136!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x60188b57efbd57c7%3A0x217e9d9fe306fba!2sHachiko%20Statue!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1773962187624!5m2!1sen!2sus" width="600" height="450" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" class="map" id="Locations"></iframe>
		

		<hr>

		<section>
		<div class="socials">
			<img src="insta.jpeg" width="100" alt="social">
			<img src="twt.jpg" width="100" alt="social">
			<img src="facebook.jpg" width="100" alt="social">
		</div>
			</section>
		
		<hr>
		
		
